@startuml
actor User
participant Discord
participant "zunda-bot-rs\nCloud Run" as Bot
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Compute Engine API" as Compute
participant DuckDNS
participant "7DTD VM\nsystemd" as VM
participant "Secret Manager" as Secrets
database "Persistent Disk" as Disk
participant "Cloud Storage\nbackup bucket" as Storage
database "BigQuery\nBilling export" as Billing
User -> Discord: /7dtd setup|allow-*|remove-*|start|status|stop
Discord -> Bot: signed interaction
alt setup / Operator management
  Bot -> DB: verify Guild-scoped administrator
  Bot -> DB: upsert config / Operator
else start / status / stop
  Bot -> DB: load Guild/Channel/User/Role authorization
  Bot -> Bot: verify channel and permission
  alt start / stop
    Bot -> DB: pg_try_advisory_xact_lock
    alt another operation is running
      DB --> Bot: false
      Bot --> Discord: 使用中メッセージ（VM APIを呼ばない）
    else lock acquired
      alt start
        Bot -> Compute: get/start
        Compute -> VM: power on
        Bot --> Discord: 起動要求受付（READYはstatusで確認）
      else stop
        Bot -> Compute: get/stop
        Compute -> VM: normal stop
        Bot --> Discord: 停止要求受付（完了はstatusで確認）
      end
    end
  else status
    Bot -> Compute: VM state / current boot READY lookup
    opt READY
      Bot -> DuckDNS: update temporary IPv4
    end
    opt stopped
      Bot -> Billing: monthly/yearly net cost
    end
    Bot --> Discord: current status
  end
end
VM -> VM: TCP 26900 readiness
VM -> Secrets: read the DuckDNS token
VM -> DuckDNS: update temporary IPv4
VM -> Compute: Guest Attributes READY
VM -> Disk: Saves / GeneratedWorlds / Mods
VM -> Disk: saveworld before shutdown
VM -> Storage: compressed backup upload
@enduml
